{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26212","headline":"中元日观诸道士步虚 · 殷尧藩","name":"中元日观诸道士步虚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玄都开秘籙，白石礼先生。\n上界秋光净，中元夜气清。\n星辰朝帝处，鸾鹤步虚声。\n玉洞花长发，珠宫月最明。\n扫坛天地肃，投简鬼神惊。\n傥赐刀圭药，还留不死名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}